# Which files of the compiler are read with the LEAN surface (note/term/lean.md, note/term/self-host/03-lean.md).
#
# Every compiler module ported to Term is written lean: that is the house style of the self-hosting port. The two
# ports that predate it (`code/term/hash.tree`, `code/term/name.tree`) were converted by `pnpm term:lean-convert`
# after `pnpm term:lean-equal` read both equal (2026-10-02).

role code
  mark lean
  take @/code/**/*.tree
  take @/test/**/*.tree
